All styles and scripts inline



Document Discovery
The viewer discovers documents through multiple sources:





flowchart LR
    VIEWER[viewer.html]
    INDEX[pdai/index.json]
    CACHE[pdai-documents.json]
    FALLBACK[Known documents]

    VIEWER --&gt; INDEX
    INDEX --&gt;|success| CATALOG
    INDEX --&gt;|fail| CACHE
    CACHE --&gt;|fail| FALLBACK

    CATALOG[Document Catalog]


 Document discovery flow 




Primary: pdai/index.json — Canonical document list
Fallback: pdai-documents.json — Cached copy at project root
Last resort: Hardcoded list of known documents

Page-Centric Structure
All path resolution uses the page-centric structure:
pdai/DocumentName/
└── pages/
    └── page_NNN/
        ├── page_NNN.png           # Image
        ├── page_NNN.xml           # OCR XML
        ├── page_NNN.html          # HTML conversion
        ├── page_NNN_translation_english.xml  # Agent output
        └── page_NNN_fig_1.png     # Extracted figure

Path Helper Functions
class DocumentViewer {
    getPagePath(pageIdx, ext) {
        const p = String(pageIdx).padStart(3, '0');
        return `${this.apiBase}/pages/page_${p}/page_${p}.${ext}`;
    }

    getAgentPath(pageIdx, agentName) {
        const p = String(pageIdx).padStart(3, '0');
        const agent = agentName.replace(/-/g, '_');
        return `${this.apiBase}/pages/page_${p}/page_${p}_${agent}.xml`;
    }

    getFigurePath(pageIdx, figNum) {
        const p = String(pageIdx).padStart(3, '0');
        return `${this.apiBase}/pages/page_${p}/page_${p}_fig_${figNum}.png`;
    }
}

Keyboard Handling
document.addEventListener('keydown', (e) =&gt; {
    switch(e.key) {
        case 'ArrowLeft':
            this.prevPage();
            break;
        case 'ArrowRight':
            this.nextPage();
            break;
        case 'ArrowUp':
            this.zoomIn();
            break;
        case 'ArrowDown':
            this.zoomOut();
            break;
        case 'd':
        case 'D':
            this.setMode('document');
            break;
        case 'a':
        case 'A':
            this.setMode('agent');
            break;
        case 'r':
        case 'R':
            this.refreshAgentResult();
            break;
        case 'f':
        case 'F':
            this.toggleFullscreen();
            break;
        case 'h':
        case 'H':
            this.toggleNavbar();
            break;
    }
});

Performance Considerations

Browser Caching
Static files are cached by the browser:



Content Type
Cache Strategy




Page images
